pyWhat (https://github.com/bee-san/pyWhat), MIT License
=======================================================
Ciphey identifies text with the pywhat crate, which embeds pyWhat's data files. The sections
below are copied from pyWhat's NOTICE (https://github.com/bee-san/pyWhat/pull/303) for the
files Ciphey's build embeds (it leaves out mac_vendors.json); docs/plaintext-detection.md
says how that is checked.


pywhat/Data/file_signatures.json
--------------------------------
Derived from the Wikipedia article "List of file signatures" by its contributors:
  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_file_signatures
  revision 1011793547 of 2021-03-12:
  https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=List_of_file_signatures&oldid=1011793547
  authors: https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=List_of_file_signatures&action=history
Changes: the article's table was converted to JSON by scripts/get_file_sigs.py (2021). The
byte order marks of big-endian UTF-16 and UTF-32 were added and the descriptions of the
little-endian ones were corrected in 2026 (#275).

